`update(dt)`:
```
dt = Math.min(dt, 0.033);
this.time += dt;
this.updateEffects(dt);
this.shakeAmt = damp(...0, 8, dt);
this.flashAmt = max(0, -dt*3);
if (this.state==='title') { update fighters? They need game state title; player.update(dt,this,enemy), enemy...; ai not; return; }
if (this.state==='intro') { ... }
if (this.state==='fight') {
  if (this.hitstopT>0) { this.hitstopT-=dt; return; } // but effects already updated
