content.text:
Now CSS. Need careful responsive.

Let's craft. Use CSS custom props.

@font-face:
```
@font-face { font-family:'Anton'; src:url('./fonts/anton.woff2') format('woff2'); font-weight:400; font-display:swap; }
...
```

Body background dark. `.hidden{opacity:0!important;pointer-events:none!important;visibility:hidden?}` For title, we want transition; use opacity and visibility delayed. Simpler `.screen.hidden{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .35s, visibility 0s .35s}`.

HUD hidden similar.

Title layout:
```
.title-screen { align-items:stretch; justify-content:stretch; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6,6,8,.86) 0%, rgba(6,6,8,.45) 34%, rgba(6,6,8,.1) 56%, rgba(6,6,8,.78) 100%); }
.title-inner{ width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; padding: clamp(20px,5vh,56px) clamp(20px,5vw,72px) clamp(20px,4vh,44px);}
.title-top...
.title-mid { margin-top: 2vh; }
.logo { font-family:Anton; font-size:clamp(88px, 19vw, 300px); line-height:.78; letter-spacing:-.015em; color:var(--paper); margin:0; text-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
.logo-dot{color:var(--red);}
.tagline{font:500 clamp(10px,1.1vw,13px)/1.8 var(--mono); letter-spacing:.28em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(...,.7); margin: clamp(12px,2vh,24px) 0 0;}
.title-bottom{display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px;}
```
On mobile, title-bottom column? Controls card maybe hidden; show touch hint. Keep actions left, control card right; on narrow <700 stack: control-card hidden maybe. Use media.

Logo on mobile 22vw (~86px) maybe. At 390px, 19vw=74px, too small. Use clamp(88px, 23vw, 300px) → 90px at 390. "POWER" width ~5*0.55*90=247, fits 390-40=350. Good. On desktop 23vw=331 at 1440, capped 300. Width ~825. Fine. Maybe cap 260. Let's use clamp(96px, 22vw, 300px). At 390 → 96 (min). Width ~264. Good.

Eyebrow mono 10px letterspacing .25em; dot red 6px.

CTA:
```
.cta{appearance:none;border:1px solid rgba(...,.45); background:rgba(...,.02); color:paper; padding:16px 22px; display:inline-flex; gap:26px; align-items:center; font:600 11px/1 mono; letter-spacing:.24em; cursor:pointer; transition:...}
.cta:hover{background:paper;color:#0a0a0d;border-color:paper;}
.cta:active{transform:translateY(1px);}
.cta-arrow{font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0;}
```
Focus-visible outline red.

Press hint 9px.

Control card: grid 2 columns, gap; each row flex; kbd. On mobile, hide keyboard hints, show touch hint. `touch-hint{display:none}` desktop; media show.

Fighters visible between title-mid and bottom? Canvas behind. The title gradient may dim. Good.

Banner: z-index 25 (below screens 30, above touch 20). pointer-events none. `inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; opacity:0;` Animation. Position center around 42%? Use `justify-content:center; padding-bottom:10vh`.

`.banner.show{opacity:1}` and `.banner-main` animation `bannerIn .5s`. To retrigger, main removes class and forces reflow. Add `will-change`.

Banner text: font Anton, size clamp(72px, 14vw, 190px), color paper, letter-spacing -.01em, line-height .8, text-align center. Sub mono red 10px letterspacing .35em.

For `.banner.ko .banner-main{color:red; text-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,59,48,.4)}`. For `.round` maybe smaller? ROUND 1 should be large. `.banner.round .banner-main{font-size:clamp(56px,10vw,140px)}`. `.banner.fight .banner-main{...}`. `FIGHT` maybe red? White.

HUD styling.

Touch controls: display none by default. `@media (hover: none), (pointer: coarse), (max-width: 860px)` display block. But a desktop browser window 800 wide shows touch controls despite mouse; could be okay but maybe not. Use `(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)` primarily, plus `max-width: 600px`. Tablets coarse. Fine.

Need to prevent the touch overlay from intercepting clicks when hidden. `.touch{display:none}`.

Stick:
```
.stick{position:absolute;left:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-left));bottom:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));width:132px;height:132px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(...,.22);background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(...,.06), rgba(...,.01));pointer-events:auto;touch-action:none;}
.stick-ring{position:absolute;inset:18px;border:1px dashed rgba(...,.1);border-radius:50%;}
.stick-knob{...}
```
Actions:
```
.actions{position:absolute;right:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-right));bottom:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,66px);grid-auto-rows:66px;gap:10px;pointer-events:none;}
.tbtn{...}
.tbtn.power{grid-column:span 2;height:38px;border-radius:20px;align-self:end;}
```
Grid auto-rows 66 makes power row 66 tall with 38 height aligned bottom; extra gap. Better use explicit grid-template-rows: 38px 66px 66px; `grid-auto-rows:66px`. Set `.actions{grid-template-rows:38px 66px 66px;}` and gap 9. Power span 2. Then 4 buttons fill 2x2. Good.

Button font 9px, letter-spacing .12em. For STRIKE maybe font 10px and border red? Add subtle: `.tbtn.strike{border-color:rgba(255,59,48,.4)}`. Power ready class set by JS: `.tbtn.power.ready{border-color:red;color:red;animation:powerPulse 1.2s infinite}`. `.tbtn.power.active{background:red;color:#0a0a0d;border-color:red}`.

Buttons active states.

Result screen:
```
.result-screen{background:rgba(6,6,8,.88); backdrop-filter: blur(6px);}
.result-inner{text-align:center; max-width:820px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:...; padding:...}
.result-title{font:400 clamp(64px,13vw,180px)/.85 Anton; color:paper; letter-spacing:-.01em}
.result-screen.defeat .result-title{color:var(--red)} maybe.
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(70px,1fr)); border-top/bottom:1px solid; ...}
.stat b{font:400 26px Anton;} label mono 8px.
```
On mobile stats 3 columns? Use grid-template-columns repeat(auto-fit,minmax(72px,1fr)). Fine.

Result eyebrow.

HUD `opacity` transitions.

Combo:
```
.combo{position:absolute;left:50%;top:22%;transform:translate(-50%,10px);font:400 clamp(24px,4vw,44px)/1 Anton;color:red;opacity:0;transition:...;pointer-events:none;z-index:18;}
.combo.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0);}
```
Maybe top 22% could overlap banner; only during fight.

Vignette/grain.

Media queries:
- max-width 720: HUD padding 12px; who 9px; hp; center vs 16; hide hud-center round label? Keep.
- title bottom stack; control-card hide keyboard rows? On touch show touch hint.
- On mobile portrait, title logo top, CTA bottom. Touch controls hidden on title? Currently touch overlay always display on coarse pointer, would show over title. We should hide touch controls when title/result visible. Add body class `in-match` toggled; `.touch` display none unless body.in-match. CSS: `.touch{display:none}`; `body.in-match .touch{display:block}` under media. Good. Main toggles body class.

- On mobile, result stats compact.

- Landscape phone: touch controls small, HUD top. Fine.

- Hide `press-hint` on touch? It says "PRESS ENTER / TAP" okay.

- Cursor.

Need `html,body{overscroll-behavior:none;}` and `touch-action:none` on game to prevent scrolling. But title scroll? No.

Let's write CSS.

input.content:
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Anton';
  src: url('./fonts/anton.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono';
  src: url('./fonts/plex-mono-400.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono';
  src: url('./fonts/plex-mono-500.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono';
  src: url('./fonts/plex-mono-600.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

:root {
  --ink: #0a0a0d;
  --ink-2: #060608;
  --paper: #f4f1e8;
  --paper-dim: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.56);
  --paper-faint: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.16);
  --red: #ff3b30;
  --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  --display: 'Anton', Impact, 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--ink-2);
  color: var(--paper);
  overscroll-behavior: none;
}

body {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

button {
  font: inherit;
  color: inherit;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
  cursor: pointer;
}

#game {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  touch-action: none;
}

#stage {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  background: var(--ink-2);
}

.vignette {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 4;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 54%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 38%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 22%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 78%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28));
}

.grain {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 5;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.055;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='180' height='180'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.86' numOctaves='2' stitchTiles='stitch'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.6'/></svg>");
  background-size: 180px 180px;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- HUD */

.hud {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 12;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 44px);
  padding: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-top)) clamp(16px, 3vw, 42px) 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
}

.hud.hidden {
  opacity: 0;
}

.hud-side {
  max-width: 440px;
  width: 100%;
}

.hud-side.rival {
  justify-self: end;
}

.hud-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.rival .hud-top {
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.who {
  font: 600 10px/1 var(--mono);
  letter-spacing: 0.28em;
  color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.8);
}

.pips {
